3
00:00:12,680 --> 00:00:14,960
How? Why? How come?

4
00:00:15,960 --> 00:00:20,460
When one mystery was solved, two new mysteries would arise.

5
00:00:20,460 --> 00:00:25,300
When two mysteries were solved, four new mysteries would arise.

6
00:00:25,300 --> 00:00:30,780
When four mysteries were solved, countless mysteries appeared.

7
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:36,680
In time, the child came to be consumed by these mysteries.

8
00:02:25,312 --> 00:02:27,312
No, stop.

9
00:02:29,312 --> 00:02:31,312
Please, don't come near me.

10
00:02:34,312 --> 00:02:35,312
Did you?

11
00:02:39,312 --> 00:02:42,312
No, I didn't mean for him to suffer like that.

12
00:02:42,312 --> 00:02:44,312
Not knowing about feelings.

13
00:02:44,312 --> 00:02:46,312
Like what it was like to be happier in love.

14
00:02:46,312 --> 00:02:50,312
I just thought it was sad and that's why, that's why...

15
00:02:55,312 --> 00:02:59,312
Quack, quack, quack, quack!

16
00:03:07,312 --> 00:03:10,312
I didn't mean it to be like this.

17
00:03:12,312 --> 00:03:14,312
Doc, we're leaving!

18
00:03:14,312 --> 00:03:17,312
Don't hurry, I'll go back to being probationary, Doc.

19
00:03:17,312 --> 00:03:19,312
Yeah, yeah, I hear ya.

20
00:03:19,312 --> 00:03:23,312
Oh man, Mewtwo hasn't been to class since then.

21
00:03:23,312 --> 00:03:25,312
