160
00:07:58,312 --> 00:08:00,312
The only one I've ever had eyes for is Muto.

161
00:08:00,312 --> 00:08:07,312
Whether or not he has a heart does not in any way change the simple fact that I love him.

162
00:08:07,312 --> 00:08:09,312
I will continue to love him.

163
00:08:09,312 --> 00:08:12,312
I'm still far from having loved him enough.

164
00:08:12,312 --> 00:08:22,312
Roo said she loves Muto.

165
00:08:22,312 --> 00:08:23,312
But I...

166
00:08:23,312 --> 00:08:24,312
The only one I've ever heard of Muto.

167
00:08:24,312 --> 00:08:25,312
So something like that.

168
00:08:33,312 --> 00:08:34,312
Snap out of it, Muto!

169
